{
  "book": "mosiah",
  "bookName": "Mosiah",
  "chapter": 8,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 344.155,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.69,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after king Limhi had made an end of speaking to his people,",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.87,
      "end": 7.285,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he spake many things unto them",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.465,
      "end": 10.251,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and only a few of them have I written in this book,",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.431,
      "end": 13.775,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he told his people all the things concerning their brethren",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 13.955,
      "end": 16.602,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who were in the land of Zarahemla.",
      "verse": "8:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 17.282,
      "end": 20.997,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he caused that Ammon should stand up before the multitude,",
      "verse": "8:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 21.177,
      "end": 25.264,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and rehearse unto them all that had happened unto their brethren",
      "verse": "8:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 25.444,
      "end": 28.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "from the time that Zeniff went up out of the land",
      "verse": "8:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 28.968,
      "end": 32.637,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even until the time that he himself came up out of the land.",
      "verse": "8:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 33.317,
      "end": 36.475,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also rehearsed unto them the last words",
      "verse": "8:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 36.655,
      "end": 39.116,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which king Benjamin had taught them,",
      "verse": "8:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 39.296,
      "end": 42.129,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and explained them to the people of king Limhi,",
      "verse": "8:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 42.309,
      "end": 45.838,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "so that they might understand all the words which he spake.",
      "verse": "8:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 46.518,
      "end": 49.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after he had done all this,",
      "verse": "8:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 49.949,
      "end": 52.457,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "king Limhi dismissed the multitude,",
      "verse": "8:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 52.637,
      "end": 56.956,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and caused that they should return every one unto his own house.",
      "verse": "8:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 57.636,
      "end": 60.562,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he caused that the plates",
      "verse": "8:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 60.742,
      "end": 66.686,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which contained the record of his people from the time that they left the land of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "8:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 66.866,
      "end": 68.863,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should be brought before Ammon,",
      "verse": "8:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 69.043,
      "end": 70.576,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might read them.",
      "verse": "8:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 71.256,
      "end": 74.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, as soon as Ammon had read the record,",
      "verse": "8:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 74.222,
      "end": 77.937,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the king inquired of him to know if he could interpret languages,",
      "verse": "8:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 78.117,
      "end": 80.207,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Ammon told him that he could not.",
      "verse": "8:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 80.887,
      "end": 82.884,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the king said unto him:",
      "verse": "8:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 83.064,
      "end": 85.943,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Being grieved for the afflictions of my people,",
      "verse": "8:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 86.123,
      "end": 88.584,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I caused that forty and three of my people",
      "verse": "8:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 88.764,
      "end": 91.318,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should take a journey into the wilderness,",
      "verse": "8:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 91.498,
      "end": 94.795,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they might find the land of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "8:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 94.975,
      "end": 99.201,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we might appeal unto our brethren to deliver us out of bondage.",
      "verse": "8:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 99.881,
      "end": 103.457,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were lost in the wilderness for the space of many days,",
      "verse": "8:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 103.637,
      "end": 105.216,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yet they were diligent,",
      "verse": "8:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 105.396,
      "end": 107.811,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and found not the land of Zarahemla",
      "verse": "8:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 107.991,
      "end": 109.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but returned to this land,",
      "verse": "8:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 109.936,
      "end": 113.047,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having traveled in a land among many waters,",
      "verse": "8:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 113.227,
      "end": 114.992,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having discovered a land",
      "verse": "8:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 115.172,
      "end": 118.887,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was covered with bones of men, and of beasts,",
      "verse": "8:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 119.067,
      "end": 122.782,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and was also covered with ruins of buildings of every kind,",
      "verse": "8:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 122.962,
      "end": 126.909,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having discovered a land which had been peopled with a people",
      "verse": "8:8",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 127.089,
      "end": 130.061,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who were as numerous as the hosts of Israel.",
      "verse": "8:8",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 130.741,
      "end": 135.757,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And for a testimony that the things that they had said are true",
      "verse": "8:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 135.937,
      "end": 138.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they have brought twenty-four plates",
      "verse": "8:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 138.857,
      "end": 141.086,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which are filled with engravings,",
      "verse": "8:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 141.266,
      "end": 143.031,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they are of pure gold.",
      "verse": "8:9",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 143.711,
      "end": 148.541,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, also, they have brought breastplates, which are large,",
      "verse": "8:10",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 148.721,
      "end": 151.043,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they are of brass and of copper,",
      "verse": "8:10",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 151.223,
      "end": 152.895,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and are perfectly sound.",
      "verse": "8:10",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 153.575,
      "end": 155.99,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, they have brought swords,",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 156.17,
      "end": 158.213,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the hilts thereof have perished,",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 158.393,
      "end": 161.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the blades thereof were cankered with rust;",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 161.638,
      "end": 166.003,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there is no one in the land that is able to interpret the language",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 166.183,
      "end": 168.598,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or the engravings that are on the plates.",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 168.778,
      "end": 170.45,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore I said unto thee:",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 170.63,
      "end": 172.302,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Canst thou translate?",
      "verse": "8:11",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 172.982,
      "end": 174.7,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I say unto thee again:",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 174.88,
      "end": 177.434,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Knowest thou of any one that can translate?",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 177.614,
      "end": 182.258,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I am desirous that these records should be translated into our language;",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 182.438,
      "end": 187.593,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for, perhaps, they will give us a knowledge of a remnant of the people",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 187.773,
      "end": 189.445,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who have been destroyed,",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 189.625,
      "end": 191.854,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "from whence these records came;",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 192.034,
      "end": 195.935,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or, perhaps, they will give us a knowledge of this very people",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 196.115,
      "end": 197.787,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who have been destroyed;",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 197.967,
      "end": 201.589,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I am desirous to know the cause of their destruction.",
      "verse": "8:12",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 202.269,
      "end": 204.173,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Ammon said unto him:",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 204.353,
      "end": 206.629,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I can assuredly tell thee, O king,",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 206.809,
      "end": 209.735,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of a man that can translate the records;",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 209.915,
      "end": 212.423,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he has wherewith that he can look,",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 212.603,
      "end": 215.947,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and translate all records that are of ancient date;",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 216.127,
      "end": 217.938,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it is a gift from God.",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 218.118,
      "end": 220.626,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the things are called interpreters,",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 220.806,
      "end": 224.103,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and no man can look in them except he be commanded,",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 224.283,
      "end": 228.138,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lest he should look for that he ought not and he should perish.",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 228.318,
      "end": 233.148,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And whosoever is commanded to look in them, the same is called seer.",
      "verse": "8:13",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 233.828,
      "end": 238.008,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, the king of the people who are in the land of Zarahemla",
      "verse": "8:14",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 238.188,
      "end": 241.067,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "is the man that is commanded to do these things,",
      "verse": "8:14",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 241.247,
      "end": 243.476,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and who has this high gift from God.",
      "verse": "8:14",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 244.156,
      "end": 247.685,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the king said that a seer is greater than a prophet.",
      "verse": "8:15",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 248.365,
      "end": 252.591,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Ammon said that a seer is a revelator and a prophet also;",
      "verse": "8:16",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 252.771,
      "end": 255.511,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and a gift which is greater can no man have,",
      "verse": "8:16",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 255.691,
      "end": 258.942,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except he should possess the power of God, which no man can;",
      "verse": "8:16",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 259.122,
      "end": 262.233,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yet a man may have great power given him from God.",
      "verse": "8:16",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 262.913,
      "end": 265.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But a seer can know of things which are past,",
      "verse": "8:17",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 265.972,
      "end": 268.387,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also of things which are to come,",
      "verse": "8:17",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 268.567,
      "end": 270.889,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by them shall all things be revealed,",
      "verse": "8:17",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 271.069,
      "end": 274.691,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or, rather, shall secret things be made manifest,",
      "verse": "8:17",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 274.871,
      "end": 277.332,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hidden things shall come to light,",
      "verse": "8:17",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 277.512,
      "end": 281.784,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and things which are not known shall be made known by them,",
      "verse": "8:17",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 281.964,
      "end": 284.425,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also things shall be made known by them",
      "verse": "8:17",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 284.605,
      "end": 286.973,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which otherwise could not be known.",
      "verse": "8:17",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 287.653,
      "end": 289.557,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thus God has provided a means",
      "verse": "8:18",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 289.737,
      "end": 291.455,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that man, through faith,",
      "verse": "8:18",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 291.635,
      "end": 293.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "might work mighty miracles;",
      "verse": "8:18",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 293.719,
      "end": 297.063,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he becometh a great benefit to his fellow beings.",
      "verse": "8:18",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 297.743,
      "end": 301.04,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, when Ammon had made an end of speaking these words",
      "verse": "8:19",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 301.22,
      "end": 303.356,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the king rejoiced exceedingly,",
      "verse": "8:19",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 303.536,
      "end": 305.626,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and gave thanks to God, saying:",
      "verse": "8:19",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 305.806,
      "end": 309.475,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Doubtless a great mystery is contained within these plates,",
      "verse": "8:19",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 309.655,
      "end": 316.993,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and these interpreters were doubtless prepared for the purpose of unfolding all such mysteries to the children of men.",
      "verse": "8:19",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 317.673,
      "end": 320.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O how marvelous are the works of the Lord,",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 320.593,
      "end": 323.101,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and how long doth he suffer with his people;",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 323.281,
      "end": 325.882,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and how blind and impenetrable",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 326.062,
      "end": 329.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "are the understandings of the children of men;",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 329.4,
      "end": 331.165,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they will not seek wisdom,",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 331.345,
      "end": 334.41,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither do they desire that she should rule over them!",
      "verse": "8:20",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 335.09,
      "end": 338.341,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, they are as a wild flock which fleeth from the shepherd,",
      "verse": "8:21",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 338.521,
      "end": 343.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and scattereth, and are driven, and are devoured by the beasts of the forest.",
      "verse": "8:21",
      "lineIndex": 110
    }
  ]
}